			"name": "Beam Weapons",
			"local_notes": "Lore: An Immortal's gauss blaster (or tesla carbine) is a heavier weapon than a Warrior's, and drilled with far more care.\n\nDesign: Beam Weapons (Rifle) (DX/E), the same family as the Warrior template. DX+4 (15) for 12 points, Easy.",
